'''The Door is Sealed''' is the second stage in [[Q5. Matter of Luck]]. Beating the stage allows the player to challenge the [[Continuation Stage]] [[The Door Opens... (Heaven)|The Door Opens...]] or [[The Door Opens... (Hell)|The Door Opens...]].

