==Battleground==
*3 [[Croco]]s (200%) spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Croco]]s (200%) spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Croco]]s (200%) spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Croco]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 40~60 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,800f</sup>.
**4 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**2 [[Mooth]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very simple stage, use any [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to easily beat the stage.

